02:25.780 --> 02:27.600
We draw a line at the halfway point.

02:27.680 --> 02:31.980
If the high for that cycle measured low to low comes to the left hand side of the mid

02:31.980 --> 02:33.580
point, it's called left translation.

02:33.580 --> 02:35.740
If it forms to the right, like this one did.

02:35.820 --> 02:36.080
Okay.

02:36.080 --> 02:37.240
Then we call it right translated.

02:37.460 --> 02:38.240
That's all it is.

02:38.280 --> 02:41.900
It's an observation of where the high forms relative to the halfway point.

02:42.060 --> 02:46.320
