02:46.320 --> 02:51.720
If you have bullish cycles chained together, like we've got here, once we've had one, two,

02:52.200 --> 02:57.760
three right translated cycles, oftentimes the fourth will left translate, meaning the peak

02:57.760 --> 02:59.580
forms to the left of the midpoint.

02:59.580 --> 03:05.020
And that means we have to spend an extended period of time trending down to correct the

03:05.020 --> 03:07.680
rest of the four year cycle measured low to low.

03:07.940 --> 03:13.620
So three rights and a left typically would complete one larger order degree cycle, a 16

03:13.620 --> 03:14.840
